<div xmlns:tal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/tal"
     class="derico-snippet"
     tal:content="structure view/markup"><!--! The `.derico-snippet` wrapper exists because the editor half needs a
     host element to inject the fragment into (`dangerouslySetInnerHTML`
     cannot render bare), and the two surfaces stay element-for-element.
     Nothing styles it; the fragment's own root does the work. --></div>
